/**
 * @defgroup HAL_ENCODER Generic Quadrature Encoder Interface
 * @brief   HAL Generic Quadrature Encoder Interface.
 * @details This module defines an abstract interface for quadrature
 *          encoders. The position is given in quadrature counts, four
 *          counts per A/B cycle. The interface also reports the position
 *          latched at the last index pulse, the index pulses count and the
 *          detected decoding errors.
 *
 * @ingroup HAL_ABSTRACT_PERIPHERALS
 */
